<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bourse start delayed by technical problem.</title>
<headline>Belgian bourse start delayed by technical problem.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical hitch delayed the start of trading on the Brussels bourse on Tuesday, a bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a technical problem,&quot; the spokesman said, adding he did not know when the problem would be solved. The market was delayed by 12 minutes at the start on Monday for similar reasons.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
